 할 최적의 개발 방법과 기술적 세부 사항입니다","es":"Las mejores prácticas de Vue Router se refieren a técnicas y patrones para configurar y utilizar de manera efectiva la biblioteca de enrutamiento de Vue.js","fr":"Les meilleures pratiques de Vue Router font référence à des techniques et des modèles pour configurer et utiliser de manière efficace la bibliothèque de routage de Vue.js","de":"Die Best Practices von Vue Router beziehen sich auf Techniken und Muster zur effektiven Konfiguration und Nutzung der Routing-Bibliothek von Vue.js","pt":"O que são melhores práticas do Vue Router? São diretrizes para uma navegação eficaz e segura em aplicações Vue","ru":"Что такое лучшие практики Vue Router? Это руководство для эффективной и безопасной навигации в приложениях Vue с помощью ИИ Агентов","ar":"ما هي أفضل الممارسات لتحسين أداء Vue Router؟ هي إرشادات لتنفيذ التنقل الفعال والأمن في تطبيقات Vue"},"features":{"en":["Navigating between same routes with different params using router-beforeenter-no-param-trigger","Accessing component instances in beforeRouteEnter guards with router-beforerouteenter-no-this","Implementing navigation guards with API calls using router-guard-async-await-pattern","Utilizing Vue 3 and Vite for optimized routing","Integrating Pinia for state management","Leveraging Tailwind CSS for styling"],"zh":["导航守卫（Navigation Guards）","路由参数（Route Parameters）","API 调用（API Calls）","beforeRouteEnter 守卫","router-beforeenter-no-param-trigger","router-guard-async-await-pattern"],"ja":["ナビゲーションガード（Navigation Guards）","ルートパラメータ（Route Parameters）","アピコール（API Calls）","beforeRouteEnter 守衛","router-beforeenter-no-param-trigger","router-guard-async-await-pattern"],"ko":["네비게이션 가드（Navigation Guards）","라우트 파라미터（Route Parameters）","API 호출（API Calls）","beforeRouteEnter 가드","router-beforeenter-no-param-trigger","router-guard-async-await-pattern"],"es":["Guardias de navegación para controlar el acceso a rutas","Patrones de navegación para una mejor experiencia del usuario","Uso de parámetros en