 TypeScript","Integration mit upstash/workflow","Einfach zu bedienen und konfigurieren"],"pt":["Funções sem servidor duráveis e confiáveis","Alto desempenho e escalabilidade","Integração fácil com aplicativos existentes","Suporte a TypeScript e outras linguagens de programação","Segurança e conformidade de dados"],"ru":["Надежные и производительные серверные функции","Высокая производительность и масштабируемость","Легкая интеграция с существующими приложениями","Поддержка TypeScript и других языков программирования","Безопасность и соответствие данных"],"ar":["وظائف خادم أقل معتمده وذكية وأداء عالية","أداء عالي ومقابل للتحسين","تكامل سهل مع التطبيقات الحالية","دعم ل TypeScript ولغات البرمجة الأخرى","أمن البيانات والامتثال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Upstash 工作流","TypeScript SDK","无服务器函数","持久、可靠、高速","工作流和数据处理","AIエージェント","Upstash 工作流 alternative","如何使用 Upstash 工作流"],"ja":["Upstash ワークフロー","TypeScript SDK","サーバーレス関数","耐久性、信頼性、パフォーマンス","ワークフローとデータ処理","AIエージェント","Upstash ワークフロー alternative","Upstash ワークフロー の使い方"],"ko":["Upstash 워크플로","TypeScript SDK","서버리스 함수","지속성, 신뢰성, 고성능","워크플ロー와 데이터 처리","AI 도구","Upstash 워크플로 alternative","Upstash 워크플로 설치 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","funciones serverless","TypeScript","upstash/workflow","guias de instalación","alternativas a upstash/workflow","cómo usar upstash/workflow","qué es upstash/workflow","configuración de upstash/workflow"],"fr":["outils d''IA","fonctions serverless","TypeScript","upstash/workflow","guides d''installation","alternatives à upstash/workflow","comment utiliser upstash/workflow","quoi est upstash/workflow","configuration de upstash/workflow"],"de":["KI-Tools","Serverless-Funktionen","TypeScript","upstash/workflow","Installationsanleitungen","Alternativen zu upstash/workflow","wie man upstash/workflow verwendet","was ist upstash/workflow","Konfiguration von upstash/workflow"],"pt":["como usar upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK","o que é upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK","upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK alternativa","upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK vs AWS Lambda","instalar upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK","guia de configuração do upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK","что такое ИИ Агенты upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK","ИИ Агенты upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK альтернатива","ИИ Агенты upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK vs AWS Lambda","установить ИИ Агенты upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK","ما هي أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK بديل","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK مقابل AWS Lambda","تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK","دليل إعداد أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK"]}},"owner":"upstash","repo":"workflow-js","repoPath":"upstash/workflow-js","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T13:13:22.514Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK Skill","description":"Lightweight guidance for using the Upstash Workflow SDK to define, trigger, and manage workflows. Use this Skill whenever a user wants to create workflow endpoints, run steps, or interact with the Upstash Workflow client.","bodyPreview":"# Upstash Workflow SDK\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThe Upstash Workflow SDK lets you expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably using QStash under the hood.\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @upstash/workflow\n```\n\nDefine a simple workflow endpoint:\n\n```ts\nimport { serve } from \"@upstash/workflow\";\n\nexport const { POST } = serve(async (context) => {\n  await context.run(\"step-1\", () => console.log(\"step 1\"));\n  await context.run(\"step-2\", () => console.log(\"step 2\"));\n});\n```\n\nTrigger it from yo","body":"# Upstash Workflow SDK\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThe Upstash Workflow SDK lets you expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably using QStash under the hood.\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @upstash/workflow\n```\n\nDefine a simple workflow endpoint:\n\n```ts\nimport { serve } from \"@upstash/workflow\";\n\nexport const { POST } = serve(async (context) => {\n  await context.run(\"step-1\", () => console.log(\"step 1\"));\n  await context.run(\"step-2\", () => console.log(\"step 2\"));\n});\n```\n\nTrigger it from your backend:\n\n```ts\nimport { Client } from \"@upstash/workflow\";\n\nconst client = new Client({ token: process.env.QSTASH_TOKEN! });\nawait client.trigger({ url: \"https://your-app.com/api/workflow\" });\n```\n\n## Other Skill Files\n\nThese files contain the full documentation. Use them for details, patterns, and advanced behavior.\n\n- basics:\n  - **basics/serve** – How to expose workflow endpoints.\n  - **basics/context** – Full API for workflow `context` (steps, waits, webhooks, events, invoke, etc.).\n  - **basics/client** – Using the Workflow client to trigger, cancel, inspect, and notify runs.\n- features:\n  - **features/invoke** – Cross‑workflow invocation.\n  - **features/reliability** – Retries, failure callbacks, and DLQ.\n  - **features/flow-control** – Rate limits, concurrency, and parallelism.\n  - **features/wait-for-event** – Notify and wait-for-event patterns.\n  - **features/webhooks** – Webhook creation and consumption.\n- how to:\n  - **how-to/local-dev** – Local QStash dev server and tunneling.\n  - **how-to/realtime** – Realtime and human‑in‑the‑loop workflows.\n  - **how-to/migrations** – Migrating workflows safely.\n  - **how-to/middleware** – Adding middleware to workflows.\n- other files:\n  - **rest-api** – Low-level REST endpoints for interacting with QStash/Workflow.\n  - **troubleshooting** – Common debugging and environment issues.\n  - **agents** – Using Workflow with agents, orchestrators, and automation patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T13:26:45.417Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing reliable serverless workflow management using TypeScript and QStash.","zh":"非常适合需要使用TypeScript和QStash进行可靠的服务器less工作流管理的Cloud Agents。","ja":"TypeScriptとQStashを使用した信頼性の高いサーバーレスワークフローマネジメントを必要とするCloud Agentsに最適です。","ko":"TypeScript와 QStash를 사용하여 안정적인 서버리스 워크플로 관리가 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes en la Nube que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo sin servidor confiable utilizando TypeScript y QStash.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud qui ont besoin d''une gestion de workflow sans serveur fiable en utilisant TypeScript et QStash.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die eine zuverlässige serverlose Workflow-Verwaltung mit TypeScript und QStash benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que necessitam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho sem servidor confiável usando TypeScript e QStash.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, которым требуется надежное управление рабочим процессом без сервера с использованием TypeScript и QStash.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء السحابيين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تدفق العمل بدون خادم موثوق بها باستخدام TypeScript و QStash."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably using QStash under the hood, providing durable, reliable, and performant serverless functions through the @upstash/workflow library.","zh":"赋予代理服务器以暴露服务器less工作流端点并使用QStash在后台运行它们的能力，从而通过@upstash/workflow库提供稳定、可靠和高性能的服务器less函数。","ja":"@upstash/workflowライブラリを通じて、耐久性、信頼性、および高性能のサーバーレス関数を提供することで、エージェントにサーバーレスワークフローのエンドポイントを公開し、QStashの下で信頼性高く実行する能力を与えます。","ko":"@upstash/workflow 라이브러리를 통해 안정적이고 신뢰할 수 있으며 성능이 뛰어난 서버리스 함수를 제공함으로써 에이전트가 서버리스 워크플로의 엔드포인트를 노출하고 QStash 아래에서 신뢰할 수 있게 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para exponer puntos finales de flujo de trabajo sin servidor y ejecutarlos de manera confiable utilizando QStash bajo la capa, proporcionando funciones sin servidor duraderas, confiables y de alto rendimiento a través de la biblioteca @upstash/workflow.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exposer des points de terminaison de workflow sans serveur et de les exécuter de manière fiable en utilisant QStash sous le capot, en fournissant des fonctions sans serveur durables, fiables et performantes via la bibliothèque @upstash/workflow.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, serverlose Workflow-Endpunkte zu exponieren und sie zuverlässig mithilfe von QStash unter der Haube auszuführen, wodurch durch die Bibliothek @upstash/workflow dauerhafte, zuverlässige und leistungsstarke serverlose Funktionen bereitgestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a expor endpoints de fluxo de trabalho sem servidor e executá-los de forma confiável usando QStash em segundo plano, fornecendo funções sem servidor duráveis, confiáveis e de alto desempenho por meio da biblioteca @upstash/workflow.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью экспонировать конечные точки рабочего процесса без сервера и запускать их надежно с использованием QStash под капотом, обеспечивая прочные, надежные и высокопроизводительные функции без сервера через библиотеку @upstash/workflow.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية عرض نقاط نهاية تدفق العمل بدون خادم وتشغيلها بطريقة موثوقة باستخدام QStash في الخلفية، مما يوفر دوال بدون خادم متينة وموثوقة وأداء عالية من خلال مكتبة @upstash/workflow."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining simple workflow endpoints","Triggering serverless workflows from external sources","Running workflows reliably with QStash"],"zh":["定义简单的工作流端点","从外部源触发服务器less工作流","使用QStash可靠地运行工作流"],"ja":["シンプルなワークフローエンドポイントを定義する","外部ソースからサーバーレスワークフローをトリガーする","QStashを使用してワークフローを信頼性高く実行する"],"ko":["단순한 워크플로 엔드포인트 정의","외부 소스에서 서버리스 워크플로 트리거","QStash를 사용하여 워크플ロー 신뢰성 있게 실행"],"es":["Definir puntos finales de flujo de trabajo simples","Disparar flujos de trabajo sin servidor desde fuentes externas","Ejecutar flujos de trabajo de manera confiable con QStash"],"fr":["Définir des points de terminaison de workflow simples","Déclencher des workflows sans serveur à partir de sources externes","Exécuter des workflows de manière fiable avec QStash"],"de":["Einfache Workflow-Endpunkte definieren","Serverlose Workflows aus externen Quellen auslösen","Workflows zuverlässig mit QStash ausführen"],"pt":["Definir pontos de extremidade de fluxo de trabalho simples","Disparar fluxos de trabalho sem servidor de fontes externas","Executar fluxos de trabalho de forma confiável com QStash"],"ru":["Определение простых конечных точек рабочего процесса","Запуск рабочих процессов без сервера из внешних источников","Запуск рабочих процессов надежно с помощью QStash"],"ar":["تحديد نقاط نهاية تدفق العمل البسيطة","تشغيل تدفقات العمل بدون خادم من مصادر خارجية","تشغيل تدفقات العمل بطريقة موثوقة مع QStash"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm installation of @upstash/workflow","TypeScript compatibility required","QStash under the hood"],"zh":["需要@upstash/workflow的npm安装","需要TypeScript兼容性","QStash在后台"],"ja":["@upstash/workflowのnpmインストールが必要","TypeScriptとの互換性が必要","QStashが下で動作"],"ko":["@upstash/workflow의 npm 설치가 필요","TypeScript와의 호환성이 필요","QStash가 내부에서 작동"],"es":["Requiere instalación de npm de @upstash/workflow","Se requiere compatibilidad con TypeScript","QStash bajo la capa"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de npm de @upstash/workflow","La compatibilité avec TypeScript est requise","QStash sous le capot"],"de":["Benötigt npm-Installation von @upstash/workflow","TypeScript-Kompatibilität erforderlich","QStash unter der Haube"],"pt":["Exige instalação do npm do @upstash/workflow","Compatibilidade com TypeScript necessária","QStash em segundo plano"],"ru":["Требует установки npm @upstash/workflow","Требуется совместимость с TypeScript","QStash под капотом"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت npm @upstash/workflow","متطلبات التوافق مع TypeScript","QStash في الخلفية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7a2a4846d405c7b003a04f778c484244ff425d08f11f1a356a714d3328f03d60","qualityScore":31}');
