INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('jllopis/kairos/changelog-gen', 'changelog-gen', 'jllopis', 'kairos', 'community', 'changelog-gen jllopis kairos community The changelog-gen skill generates user-friendly changelogs from git commits, benefiting developers and customers alike by providing clear release notes and update summaries. Changelog-gen是一种自动化变更日志生成工具，支持Git提交转换为易于使用的变更日志 Changelog-genは、Gitコミットを容易に使用できる変更ログに自動変換するAIエージェントツールです Changelog-gen은 Git 커밋을 쉽게 사용할 수 있는 변경 로그로 자동 변환하는 AI 에이전트 도구입니다 changelog-gen es un generador de notas de versión que transforma commits técnicos de git en changelogs elegantes y fáciles de usar changelog-gen est un générateur de notes de version qui transforme les commits techniques de git en des changelogs élégants et faciles à utiliser changelog-gen ist ein Versionshinweis-Generator, der technische Git-Commits in elegante und benutzerfreundliche Changelogs umwandelt O Changelog-Gen é uma skill de agente IA que gera changelogs a partir de commits Git, tornando-os fáceis de entender e usar Changelog-Gen - это навык ИИ Агента, который генерирует чейнджлоги из коммитов Git, делая их легко понимаемыми и используемыми Changelog-Gen هو مهارة وكيل الإيمان العقلانية التي تولد سجلات التغيير من التعديلات في كود المصدر، مما يسهل فهمها واستخدامها how to use changelog-gen changelog-gen alternative changelog-gen setup guide what is changelog-gen changelog-gen vs conventional changelog automated changelog generation changelog-gen install git commit to changelog Changelog-gen 自动化变更日志生成 Git提交转换 AIエージェント OpenTelemetry 变更日志工具 代码质量提高 开发效率提高 Transforms git commits into elegant and easy-to-use changelogs Supports preparation of release notes for new software releases Enables creation of weekly or monthly product update summaries Facilitates documentation of changes for customers Generates content for app store listings, such as App Store and Play Store changelog-gen is a Go-native framework agent skill focused on interoperability and observability, generating changelogs from git commits for easier release management.');
