, das das Domänen-Modell von der Infrastruktur trennt","pt":"A arquitetura limpa em Go é uma abordagem de design de software que separa as preocupações em camadas","ru":"Чистая архитектура в Go - это подход к проектированию программного обеспечения, который разделяет проблемы на отдельные слои","ar":"هندسة گو النظيفة هي نهج تصميم البرمجيات الذي يفصل المشاكل إلى طبقات منفصلة"},"features":{"en":["Separates concerns into distinct layers, including domain, repository, and framework layers","Enforces domain logic and validation in the innermost domain layer","Defines contracts for outer layers through repository interfaces","Supports statistical analysis of Go and Python source code","Ensures pure business logic in the domain layer with no external dependencies","Organizes code into a structured directory layout, including internal/domain/"],"zh":["Domain Layer（内部层）","Repository interfaces","业务实体（structs）","领域逻辑和验证","无外部依赖"],"ja":["Domain Layer（最も内側の層）","Repository interfaces","ビジネスエンティティ（structs）","ドメインロジックとバリデーション","外部依存関係なし"],"ko":["Domain Layer（내부層）","Repository interfaces","비즈니스 엔티티（structs）","도메인 로직과 검증","외부 의존성 없음"],"es":["Análisis estadístico de código fuente en Go y Python","Estructura de capas con dominio en el centro","Dependencias hacia el dominio","Sin dependencias externas en la capa de dominio","Lógica de negocio y validación en la capa de dominio"],"fr":["Analyse statistique de code source en Go et Python","Structure de couches avec le domaine au centre","Dépendances vers le domaine","Pas de dépendances externes dans la couche de domaine","Logique métier et validation dans la couche de domaine"],"de":["Statistische Analyse von Quellcode in Go und Python","Schichtenstruktur mit Domänen-Modell im Zentrum","Abhängigkeiten zum Domänen-Modell","Keine externen Abhängigkeiten in der Domänen-Schicht","Geschäftslogik und Validierung in der Domänen-Schicht"],"pt":["Separação de preocupações em camadas distintas","Dependências apontando para dentro em direção ao domínio","Camada de domínio com lógica de negócios e validação","Suporte a análise estatística de código-fonte em Go e Python"],"ru":["Разделение проблем на отдельные слои","Зависимости, указывающие внутрь к домену","Слой домена с логикой бизнеса и валидацией","Поддержка статистического анализа кода на Go и Python"],"ar":["فصل المشاكل إلى طبقات منفصلة","الاعتماديات التي تشير داخلًا نحو المجال","طبقة المجال مع منطق الأعمال والتحقق","دعم تحليل الشفرة الإحصائي في گو وپایثون"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use go-clean-architecture","go-clean-architecture setup guide","go-clean-architecture vs clean architecture","go-clean-architecture install","what is go-clean-architecture","go-clean-architecture alternative","go-clean-architecture for AI agents","statistical analysis of source code","go-clean-architecture best practices","go-clean-architecture tutorial"],"zh":["Go Clean Architecture","软件设计模式","分层架构","Domain Layer","Repository interfaces","AIエージェント","Go开发","软件架构"],"ja":["Go Clean Architecture","ソフトウェア設計パターン","分層アーキテクチャ","Domain Layer","Repository interfaces","AIエージェント","Go開発","ソフトウェアアーキテクチャ"],"ko":["Go Clean Architecture","소프트웨어 디자인 패턴","분层 아키텍처","Domain Layer","Repository interfaces","AI 도구","Go 개발","소프트웨어 아키텍처"],"es":["arquitectura limpia en Go","análisis estadístico de código fuente","diseño de software en Go","desarrollo de aplicaciones en Go","patrones de diseño en Go","Go y Python"],"fr":["architecture propre en Go","analyse statistique de code source","conception de logiciels en Go","développement d''applications en Go","modèles de conception en Go","Go et Python"],"de":["Clean Architecture in Go","statistische Analyse von Quellcode","Software-Design in Go","Anwendungsentwicklung in Go","Entwurfsmuster in Go","Go und Python"],"pt":["arquitetura limpa em Go","análise estatística de código-fonte","desenvolvimento de software em Go","Go clean architecture","ferramentas de análise de código","desenvolvimento de aplicações em Go"],"ru":["чистая архитектура в Go","статистический анализ кода","разработка программного обеспечения на Go","ИИ Агенты для анализа кода","инструменты для анализа кода","разработка приложений на Go"],"ar":["هندسة گو النظيفة","تحليل الشفرة الإحصائي","تطوير البرمجيات في گو","أدوات تحليل الشفرة","تطوير التطبيقات في گو","الوكلاء الذكية لتحليل الشفرة"]}},"owner":"zskulcsar","repo":"code-stats","repoPath":"zskulcsar/code-stats","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T12:59:22.269Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"go-clean-architecture","description":"Expert knowledge in Go clean architecture patterns and best practices","bodyPreview":"# Go Clean Architecture Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nClean Architecture in Go emphasizes separation of concerns through distinct layers, with dependencies pointing inward toward the domain.\n\n## Layer Structure\n\n### Domain Layer (innermost)\n**Location:** `internal/domain/`\n\n**Contains:**\n- Business entities (structs)\n- Repository interfaces\n- Domain logic and validation\n- Business rules\n\n**Rules:**\n- NO external dependencies\n- NO framework dependencies\n- Pure business logic\n- Defines contracts for outer l","body":"# Go Clean Architecture Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nClean Architecture in Go emphasizes separation of concerns through distinct layers, with dependencies pointing inward toward the domain.\n\n## Layer Structure\n\n### Domain Layer (innermost)\n**Location:** `internal/domain/`\n\n**Contains:**\n- Business entities (structs)\n- Repository interfaces\n- Domain logic and validation\n- Business rules\n\n**Rules:**\n- NO external dependencies\n- NO framework dependencies\n- Pure business logic\n- Defines contracts for outer layers\n\n**Example:**\n```go\n// internal/domain/account.go\npackage domain\n\ntype Account struct {\n    ID      string\n    Name    string\n    Type    AccountType\n    Balance int // cents\n}\n\ntype AccountRepository interface {\n    Create(account *Account) error\n    GetByID(id string) (*Account, error)\n    Update(account *Account) error\n    Delete(id string) error\n}\n\n// Domain validation\nfunc (a *Account) Validate() error {\n    if a.Name == \"\" {\n        return ErrInvalidName\n    }\n    if !a.Type.IsValid() {\n        return ErrInvalidType\n    }\n    return nil\n}\n```\n\n### Application Layer (middle)\n**Location:** `internal/application/`\n\n**Contains:**\n- Business logic services\n- Use case orchestration\n- Service interfaces\n- Cross-cutting concerns\n\n**Rules:**\n- Depends ONLY on domain interfaces\n- NO HTTP dependencies\n- NO database dependencies\n- Orchestrates domain entities\n\n**Example:**\n```go\n// internal/application/account_service.go\npackage application\n\nimport \"internal/domain\"\n\ntype AccountService struct {\n    repo domain.AccountRepository // Interface, not concrete type\n}\n\nfunc NewAccountService(repo domain.AccountRepository) *AccountService {\n    return &AccountService{repo: repo}\n}\n\nfunc (s *AccountService) CreateAccount(account *domain.Account) error {\n    if err := account.Validate(); err != nil {\n        return fmt.Errorf(\"validation failed: %w\", err)\n    }\n\n    if err := s.repo.Create(account); err != nil {\n        return fmt.Errorf(\"failed to create account: %w\", err)\n    }\n\n    return nil\n}\n```\n\n### Infrastructure Layer (outermost)\n**Location:** `internal/infrastructure/`\n\n**Contains:**\n- Repository implementations\n- HTTP handlers\n- Database logic\n- External service integrations\n\n**Rules:**\n- Implements domain interfaces\n- Can have external dependencies\n- Handlers should be thin (parse → service → respond)\n- Repositories only handle persistence\n\n**Example:**\n```go\n// internal/infrastructure/repository/account_repository.go\npackage repository\n\nimport (\n    \"database/sql\"\n    \"internal/domain\"\n)\n\ntype AccountRepository struct {\n    db *sql.DB\n}\n\nfunc NewAccountRepository(db *sql.DB) *AccountRepository {\n    return &AccountRepository{db: db}\n}\n\nfunc (r *AccountRepository) Create(account *domain.Account) error {\n    query := `INSERT INTO accounts (id, name, type, balance) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)`\n    _, err := r.db.Exec(query, account.ID, account.Name, account.Type, account.Balance)\n    return err\n}\n\n// internal/infrastructure/http/handlers/account_handler.go\npackage handlers\n\ntype AccountHandler struct {\n    service *application.AccountService\n}\n\nfunc (h *AccountHandler) CreateAccount(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    // 1. Parse request\n    var req CreateAccountRequest\n    if err := json.NewDecoder(r.Body).Decode(&req); err != nil {\n        http.Error(w, \"invalid request\", http.StatusBadRequest)\n        return\n    }\n\n    // 2. Call service\n    account := req.ToDomain()\n    if err := h.service.CreateAccount(account); err != nil {\n        http.Error(w, err.Error(), http.StatusInternalServerError)\n        return\n    }\n\n    // 3. Return response\n    w.WriteHeader(http.StatusCreated)\n    json.NewEncoder(w).Encode(account)\n}\n```\n\n## Dependency Injection\n\nWire dependencies in main.go:\n\n```go\n// cmd/server/main.go\nfunc main() {\n    // Infrastructure\n    db := setupDatabase()\n\n    // Repositories (concrete implementations)\n    accountRepo := repository.NewAccountRepository(db)\n\n    // Services (injected with interfaces)\n    accountService := application.NewAccountService(accountRepo)\n\n    // Handlers (injected with services)\n    accountHandler := handlers.NewAccountHandler(accountService)\n\n    // Router\n    router := setupRouter(accountHandler)\n\n    http.ListenAndServe(\":8080\", router)\n}\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Repository Pattern\n```go\n// Domain defines interface\ntype Repository interface {\n    Create(entity *Entity) error\n    GetByID(id string) (*Entity, error)\n}\n\n// Infrastructure implements\ntype SQLRepository struct {\n    db *sql.DB\n}\n\nfunc (r *SQLRepository) Create(entity *Entity) error {\n    // SQL implementation\n}\n```\n\n### Service Pattern\n```go\ntype Service struct {\n    repo domain.Repository  // Depend on interface\n}\n\nfunc (s *Service) DoBusinessLogic(entity *domain.Entity) error {\n    // Validate\n    // Transform\n    // Call repository\n    return s.repo.Create(entity)\n}\n```\n\n### Handler Pattern\n```go\nfunc (h *Handler) HandleRequest(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    // Parse → Service → Respond\n    req := parseRequest(r)\n    result, err := h.service.Do(req)\n    respond(w, result, err)\n}\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n### ❌ Domain with External Dependencies\n```go\n// BAD: Domain importing database\nimport \"database/sql\"\n\ntype Account struct {\n    db *sql.DB  // ❌ Domain shouldn''t know about database\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ Service with HTTP/Database\n```go\n// BAD: Service with HTTP dependency\nfunc (s *Service) Create(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    // ❌ Service shouldn''t handle HTTP\n}\n\n// BAD: Service with database dependency\nfunc (s *Service) Create(db *sql.DB, entity *Entity) error {\n    // ❌ Service should use repository interface\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ Handler with Business Logic\n```go\n// BAD: Complex logic in handler\nfunc (h *Handler) Create(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    // Parse\n    // ❌ Complex validation\n    // ❌ Calculations\n    // ❌ Business rules\n    // Direct database access\n}\n\n// GOOD: Thin handler\nfunc (h *Handler) Create(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    req := parse(r)\n    result := h.service.Create(req)  // Service has the logic\n    respond(w, result)\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ Repository with Business Logic\n```go\n// BAD: Business rules in repository\nfunc (r *Repository) Create(account *Account) error {\n    // ❌ Business validation in repository\n    if account.Balance < 0 && account.Type != \"credit\" {\n        return errors.New(\"invalid\")\n    }\n    // Should only handle persistence\n}\n```\n\n## Testing Strategy\n\n### Domain Tests\n```go\nfunc TestAccount_Validate(t *testing.T) {\n    // Test entity validation\n    // No mocks needed\n}\n```\n\n### Service Tests (Unit)\n```go\nfunc TestService_Create(t *testing.T) {\n    mockRepo := &MockRepository{}  // Mock interface\n    service := NewService(mockRepo)\n    // Test business logic\n}\n```\n\n### Repository Tests (Integration)\n```go\nfunc TestRepository_Create(t *testing.T) {\n    db := setupTestDB()  // Real database\n    repo := NewRepository(db)\n    // Test persistence\n}\n```\n\n### Handler Tests (E2E)\n```go\nfunc TestHandler_Create(t *testing.T) {\n    mockService := &MockService{}\n    handler := NewHandler(mockService)\n    req := httptest.NewRequest(\"POST\", \"/\", body)\n    w := httptest.NewRecorder()\n    handler.Create(w, req)\n    // Test HTTP layer\n}\n```\n\n## Benefits\n\n✅ **Testability**: Easy to mock dependencies\n✅ **Maintainability**: Clear separation of concerns\n✅ **Flexibility**: Easy to swap implementations\n✅ **Independence**: Domain logic independent of frameworks\n✅ **Scalability**: Easy to add features\n\n## When to Apply\n\n- Multi-layer applications\n- Complex business logic\n- Long-lived projects\n- Team projects requiring clear boundaries\n- Applications that may change databases/frameworks\n\n## Quick Checklist\n\n- [ ] Domain has no external dependencies\n- [ ] Application uses interfaces, not concrete types\n- [ ] Handlers are thin (parse → service → respond)\n- [ ] Repositories only handle persistence\n- [ ] Dependencies point inward\n- [ ] Business logic in services, not handlers\n- [ ] Each layer has clear responsibility\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T15:04:27.464Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Analysis Agents specializing in Go/Python architecture validation and dependency mapping.","zh":"非常适合专注于 Go/Python 架构验证和依赖关系映射的代码分析智能体。","ja":"Go/Python のアーキテクチャ検証と依存関係マッピングを専門とするコード分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Go/Python 아키텍처 검증 및 의존성 매핑을 전문으로 하는 코드 분석 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Código que se especializan en la validación de arquitectura Go/Python y el mapeo de dependencias.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code spécialisés dans la validation de l''architecture Go/Python et la cartographie des dépendances.","de":"Ideal für Code-Analyse-Agenten, die sich auf die Validierung der Go/Python-Architektur und die Abbildung von Abhängigkeiten spezialisieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Código especializados na validação de arquitetura Go/Python e mapeamento de dependências.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Анализа Кода, специализирующихся на проверке архитектуры Go/Python и составлении карты зависимостей.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحليل التعليمات البرمجية المتخصصين في التحقق من بنية Go/Python ورسم خرائط التبعيات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated statistical analysis of Go and Python source code to enforce Clean Architecture principles. Provides layer-specific dependency validation and domain logic isolation through repository interface analysis.","zh":"支持对 Go 和 Python 源代码进行自动化统计分析，以强制执行 Clean Architecture 原则。通过 Repository 接口分析提供特定于层的依赖关系验证和领域逻辑隔离。","ja":"Go および Python ソースコードの自動統計分析を可能にし、Clean Architecture 原則の実施を強制します。Repository インターフェース分析を通じて、レイヤー固有の依存関係検証とドメインロジックの分離を提供します。","ko":"Go 및 Python 소스 코드에 대한 자동화된 통계 분석을 가능하게 하여 Clean Architecture 원칙을 시행합니다. Repository 인터페이스 분석을 통해 계층별 의존성 검증 및 도메인 로직 분리를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita el análisis estadístico automatizado del código fuente de Go y Python para hacer cumplir los principios de Arquitectura Limpia. Proporciona una validación de dependencias específicas de la capa y una aislamiento de la lógica de dominio a través del análisis de la interfaz del repositorio.","fr":"Permet l''analyse statistique automatisée du code source Go et Python pour faire respecter les principes d''Architecture Propre. Fournit une validation de dépendances spécifiques à la couche et une isolation de la logique de domaine via l''analyse de l''interface de référentiel.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatisierte statistische Analyse von Go- und Python-Quellcode, um die Grundsätze der sauberen Architektur durchzusetzen. Bietet eine validationspezifische Abhängigkeitsprüfung und eine Trennung der Domänenlogik durch die Analyse der Repository-Schnittstelle.","pt":"Permite a análise estatística automatizada de código-fonte Go e Python para impor os princípios da Clean Architecture. Fornece validação de dependência específica por camada e isolamento da lógica de domínio por meio da análise da interface do repositório.","ru":"Обеспечивает автоматизированный статистический анализ исходного кода Go и Python для соблюдения принципов Clean Architecture. Обеспечивает проверку зависимостей для конкретных слоев и изоляцию доменной логики посредством анализа интерфейсов репозитория.","ar":"يتيح التحليل الإحصائي الآلي للتعليمة البرمجية المصدرية بلغة Go وPython لفرض مبادئ Clean Architecture. يوفر التحقق من التبعيات الخاصة بطبقة معينة وعزل منطق النطاق من خلال تحليل واجهة المستودع."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating dependency direction in Go projects","Analyzing Python codebase layer separation","Generating architecture compliance reports","Identifying domain logic contamination in outer layers"],"zh":["验证 Go 项目中的依赖方向","分析 Python 代码库的层分离","生成架构合规性报告","识别外层中的领域逻辑污染"],"ja":["Go プロジェクトにおける依存関係の方向性の検証","Python コードベースのレイヤー分離の分析","アーキテクチャ準拠レポートの生成","外部レイヤーにおけるドメインロジック汚染の特定"],"ko":["Go 프로젝트의 의존성 방향 검증","Python 코드베이스의 계층 분리 분석","아키텍처 준수 보고서 생성","외부 계층에서의 도메인 로직 오염 식별"],"es":["Validar la dirección de dependencia en proyectos Go","Analizar la separación de capas en la base de código Python","Generar informes de cumplimiento de arquitectura","Identificar la contaminación de la lógica de dominio en capas externas"],"fr":["Valider la direction des dépendances dans les projets Go","Analyser la séparation des couches dans la base de code Python","Générer des rapports de conformité d''architecture","Identifier la contamination de la logique de domaine dans les couches externes"],"de":["Überprüfen der Abhängigkeitsrichtung in Go-Projekten","Analysieren der Trennung von Schichten in der Python-Codebasis","Erstellen von Architekturkonformitätsberichten","Identifizieren der Kontamination der Domänenlogik in äußeren Schichten"],"pt":["Validação da direção de dependência em projetos Go","Análise da separação de camadas na base de código Python","Geração de relatórios de conformidade de arquitetura","Identificação de contaminação da lógica de domínio nas camadas externas"],"ru":["Проверка направления зависимостей в проектах Go","Анализ разделения слоев в кодовой базе Python","Генерация отчетов о соответствии архитектуры","Выявление загрязнения доменной логики во внешних слоях"],"ar":["التحقق من اتجاه التبعية في مشاريع Go","تحليل فصل الطبقات في قاعدة التعليمات البرمجية Python","إنشاء تقارير الامتثال للهيكلة","تحديد تلوث منطق النطاق في الطبقات الخارجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Go and Python languages only","Requires source code access","Limited to Clean Architecture pattern validation"],"zh":["仅限 Go 和 Python 语言","需要源代码访问权限","仅限于 Clean Architecture 模式验证"],"ja":["Go および Python 言語のみ","ソースコードへのアクセスが必要","Clean Architecture パターンの検証に限定"],"ko":["Go 및 Python 언어만 해당","소스 코드 접근 권한 필요","Clean Architecture 패턴 검증으로 제한됨"],"es":["Solo los lenguajes Go y Python","Requiere acceso al código fuente","Limitado a la validación del patrón de Arquitectura Limpia"],"fr":["Seulement les langages Go et Python","Nécessite un accès au code source","Limité à la validation du modèle d''Architecture Propre"],"de":["Nur die Sprachen Go und Python","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Quellcode","Begrenzt auf die Validierung des Musters der sauberen Architektur"],"pt":["Apenas linguagens Go e Python","Requer acesso ao código-fonte","Limitado à validação do padrão Clean Architecture"],"ru":["Только языки Go и Python","Требует доступ к исходному коду","Ограничено проверкой шаблона Clean Architecture"],"ar":["لغتي Go وPython فقط","يتطلب الوصول إلى التعليمة البرمجية المصدرية","يقتصر على التحقق من نمط Clean Architecture"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f7a6a0920578a5