INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('kenccha/processcheck/scout', 'scout', 'kenccha', 'processcheck', 'community', 'scout kenccha processcheck community The Scout skill enables developers to discover new features through competitor analysis and trend research, benefiting AI agent developers and project managers. It streamlines the feature discovery process. Scout功能探索是通过竞争对手分析和趋势研究来发现新功能的过程 Scout AIエージェントは、競争相手分析とトレンド調査を通じて新機能を発見します Scout 기능 탐색은 경쟁 제품 분석과 트렌드 조사를 통해 새로운 기능을 발굴하는 과정입니다 Scout es una herramienta de análisis de tendencias y benchmarking que utiliza WebSearch para recopilar información Scout est un outil d''analyse de tendances et de benchmarking qui utilise WebSearch pour collecter des informations Scout ist ein Tool für Trend- und Benchmark-Analysen, das WebSearch zur Informationsbeschaffung nutzt O Scout é uma ferramenta de análise de funcionalidades de projeto que ajuda a identificar gaps e melhorar o workflow ИИ Агент Scout - это инструмент анализа функций проекта, который помогает выявить пробелы и улучшить рабочий процесс مسؤول الكشافة هو أداة لتحليل ميزات المشروع التي تساعد في تحديد الفجوات وتحسين سير العمل how to use scout scout alternative scout setup guide what is scout scout vs competitor analysis scout feature discovery scout benchmarking scout AI agent skill Scout功能探索 AI工具 竞争对手分析 趋势研究 功能提案 WebSearch 自动化工作流 移动开发 Analyzes competitors and trends using WebSearch Reads existing features and proposals from CLAUDE.md and docs/feature-review-2026.md Generates improvement proposals based on gap analysis Supports investigation of specific topics using $ARGUMENTS Integrates with ProcessCheck to identify new feature opportunities Scout is a feature discovery and benchmarking skill that analyzes competitors and trends to identify new features and generate improvement proposals.');
